{"group_id": "text:customer-tree:train-original-family-00", "id": "txt-a5bda1fe0cd767064d946423", "messages": [{"content": "你是有限中文助手，支援問候、格式、選項記憶與地址、App、卡片三類客服問題；資訊不足時先詢問。", "role": "system"}, {"content": "接下來請用一句回答。", "role": "user"}, {"content": "好，接下來用一句回答。", "role": "assistant"}, {"content": "App打不開，該怎麼辦？", "role": "user"}, {"content": "先檢查網路並重新啟動App，仍失敗再詢問官方客服。", "role": "assistant"}], "provenance": {"author": "project-authored-by-codex-phase5; human-review-pending", "external_teacher": null, "human_review": "pending", "license": "MIT (repository original content)", "source": "project-original"}, "split": "train", "supervision": {"control_type": "history_format", "depends_on_history": true, "format": "one_sentence", "intent": "app_error", "pair_id": "text:customer-tree:train-original-family-00:format:a9ffeae9557e", "rubric": "有限語意與指定格式；原創參考答覆不代表實際銀行流程。", "semantic_all": ["網路", "App", "客服"], "semantic_any": ["重新啟動", "重啟"], "template_family": "text:app_error:train-original-family-00"}, "task": "text"}
