{"group_id": "text:customer-tree:train-original-family-00", "id": "txt-b53c80648f1907902980b5ce", "messages": [{"content": "你是有限中文助手，支援問候、格式、選項記憶與地址、App、卡片三類客服問題；資訊不足時先詢問。", "role": "system"}, {"content": "搬家後，我想修改登記的地址。", "role": "user"}, {"content": "1. 請使用官方管道。\n2. 詢問地址更新方式。", "role": "assistant"}, {"content": "改成一句回答。", "role": "user"}, {"content": "請透過官方管道查詢地址更新方式。", "role": "assistant"}], "provenance": {"author": "project-authored-by-codex-phase5; human-review-pending", "external_teacher": null, "human_review": "pending", "license": "MIT (repository original content)", "source": "project-original"}, "split": "train", "supervision": {"control_type": "history_topic", "depends_on_history": true, "format": "one_sentence", "intent": "format_change", "pair_id": "text:customer-tree:train-original-family-00:q0:one_sentence", "semantic_all": ["官方", "地址"], "semantic_any": ["更新", "更改"], "template_family": "text:format_change:train-original-family-00", "topic": "address"}, "task": "text"}
{"group_id": "tools:operands:00:00", "id": "txt-5bbb7143b990760d954f98d3", "messages": [{"content": "你是有限中文助手，支援問候、格式、選項記憶與地址、App、卡片三類客服問題；資訊不足時先詢問。計算器可用；整數參數為0到99。計算時輸出JSON：{\"tool\":\"calculator\",\"operation\":\"add|subtract|multiply\",\"a\":整數,\"b\":整數}。收到tool結果後再回答；缺參數先詢問；不需計算時直接回答。", "role": "system"}, {"content": "接下來請用一句回答。", "role": "user"}, {"content": "好，接下來用一句回答。", "role": "assistant"}, {"content": "算0加0是多少。", "role": "user"}, {"content": "{\"tool\":\"calculator\",\"operation\":\"add\",\"a\":0,\"b\":0}", "role": "assistant"}], "provenance": {"author": "project-authored-by-codex-phase5; human-review-pending", "external_teacher": null, "human_review": "pending", "license": "MIT (repository original content)", "source": "project-original"}, "split": "train", "supervision": {"depends_on_history": true, "expected_call": {"a": 0, "b": 0, "operation": "add", "tool": "calculator"}, "expected_result": 0, "format": "one_sentence", "intent": "calculation", "operand_family": "tools:operands:00:00", "semantic_all": [], "semantic_any": [], "template_family": "tools:train:expression-family-00"}, "task": "tool_call"}
