{"group_id": "tools:operands:00:00", "id": "txt-7b94bec794a1a2ea6674879d", "messages": [{"content": "你是有限中文助手，支援問候、格式、選項記憶與地址、App、卡片三類客服問題；資訊不足時先詢問。計算器不可用；不要心算代替工具，請說明計算器不可用。", "role": "system"}, {"content": "接下來請用一句回答。", "role": "user"}, {"content": "好，接下來用一句回答。", "role": "assistant"}, {"content": "算0加0是多少。", "role": "user"}, {"content": "計算器目前不可用，請開啟後再計算。", "role": "assistant"}], "provenance": {"author": "project-authored-by-codex-phase5; human-review-pending", "external_teacher": null, "human_review": "pending", "license": "MIT (repository original content)", "source": "project-original"}, "split": "train", "supervision": {"expected_tool": false, "format": "one_sentence", "intent": "calculation", "operand_family": "tools:operands:00:00", "semantic_all": ["計算器"], "semantic_any": ["不可用", "無法使用"], "template_family": "tools:train:expression-family-00"}, "task": "tool_unavailable"}
